# PinPolicy

Require pinned versions vs ranges in package.json — catch `^`, `~`, `*`, `latest`, and open bounds before they float. Pairs with [RangeRisk](https://rangerisk.dev) (range *risk* vs pin *policy*).

Report findings with paths and remediation. Do not invent findings.
